    <profile name="Mighty Champion" id="f277-a533-a068-246f" hidden="false" page="28" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="219f-0faa-a2d8-f766" typeName="Unit">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="49de-956f-8797-7436">Mighty Champion</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="M" typeId="4934-7872-3dd7-a8b6">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="WS" typeId="dc18-b600-96a9-a4a3">6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="BS" typeId="f859-88a3-fdd3-b298">6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="5916-04ef-0fd1-6557">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="T" typeId="2e7d-2383-f92f-16f9">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="W" typeId="ce31-f767-c572-72cc">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="I" typeId="a9b1-bae9-25d0-fdbf">6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="A" typeId="e39a-b0ee-e6d1-e661">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="LD" typeId="c751-ec1f-edb8-fd83">9</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Rod of Command" id="dd56-ae98-39a4-39b8" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Once per battle may be used to command a friendly unit anywhere on the table to move twice in a single turn. The affected unit moves and then immediately has another movement phase. In addition, any friendly units within 24&quot; of N&apos;Kari may make Leadership tests using N&apos;Kari&apos;s Leadership of 11</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Doombolt" id="1ce0-83d3-745e-08ae" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="11a6-8e13-a1ad-7e34" typeName="Unit Psychic Powers">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Name" typeId="f6df-d058-1a8b-c2f7">Doombolt</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Cast on" typeId="f4e5-8437-16be-8b1f">Automatically, but may be nullified</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="8ec1-f69b-9d13-1fff">Strike first model in it&apos;s path, up to 18&quot; away. Target suffers D6 S5 hits with a -2 save. Vehicles or buildings take a singlt hit with an armour penetration of D6x5</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mark of Slaanesh" id="61ac-8b69-fa76-e00d" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Immune to all psychology tests. Never needs to take a Break test. If N&apos;Kari is with a unit that is forced to flee then he is not affected and can continue to fight as normal</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Aura of Slaanesh" id="f87d-dc0d-097e-150f" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">In close combat, enemy models must test against their Leadership on 3D6 to be able to strike N&apos;Kari. If they fail, they fight normally but if they win the combat they will not strike the model so any hits are wasted and the combat is a draw. If they pass they do not have to pass again</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="M&apos;Kachan, Daemon Prince of Tzeentch" id="5173-5317-593c-f9b6" hidden="false" page="141" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="219f-0faa-a2d8-f766" typeName="Unit">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="49de-956f-8797-7436">M&apos;Kachan</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="M" typeId="4934-7872-3dd7-a8b6">8</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="WS" typeId="dc18-b600-96a9-a4a3">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="BS" typeId="f859-88a3-fdd3-b298">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="5916-04ef-0fd1-6557">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="T" typeId="2e7d-2383-f92f-16f9">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="W" typeId="ce31-f767-c572-72cc">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="I" typeId="a9b1-bae9-25d0-fdbf">10</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="A" typeId="e39a-b0ee-e6d1-e661">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="LD" typeId="c751-ec1f-edb8-fd83">10</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Foulspawn" id="8e14-75f7-d3fe-1207" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="219f-0faa-a2d8-f766" typeName="Unit">
      <characteristics>
